   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How do several people use the web interface so that anyone can read, only admins and moderators act, and what each role may do is decided in one\nplace?",
   "originalText": "How do several people use the web interface so that anyone can read, only admins and moderators act, and what each role may do is decided in one\nplace?",
