  {
   "id": "adr-context-text",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 46,
   "y": 279.0,
   "width": 1488,
   "height": 140.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 106584860,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 392094838,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• The web interface had no login: it was safe only because it answered on this machine and took form posts only from its own pages.\n• To run it for others, the public must be able to browse trials, sponsors and judgements but start, change and spend nothing, in the pages or by\n  calling the routes (curl, a script).\n• Two kinds of people act: admins (sources, model calls that cost money, users) and moderators (curating trials and their evidence). More roles may\n  come.\n• Every write is already audited per core.actor, but every web write was recorded as the account running the server.\n• No external services: it runs in Docker Compose next to Postgres.",
   "originalText": "• The web interface had no login: it was safe only because it answered on this machine and took form posts only from its own pages.\n• To run it for others, the public must be able to browse trials, sponsors and judgements but start, change and spend nothing, in the pages or by\n  calling the routes (curl, a script).\n• Two kinds of people act: admins (sources, model calls that cost money, users) and moderators (curating trials and their evidence). More roles may\n  come.\n• Every write is already audited per core.actor, but every web write was recorded as the account running the server.\n• No external services: it runs in Docker Compose next to Postgres.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-context",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
