    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optA-text",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 46,
   "y": 491.0,
   "width": 468,
   "height": 220.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 724609555,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1449209246,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A. Role checks inside each route\n\nHow it works: each route compares the signed-in\nuser's role with names written in it (if role ==\n\"admin\").\n\n+ smallest change\n– the rule is spread over every route; a route\n  without a check is open and nothing notices\n– a new role means editing every route\n– nobody can see who may do what",
   "originalText": "A. Role checks inside each route\n\nHow it works: each route compares the signed-in\nuser's role with names written in it (if role ==\n\"admin\").\n\n+ smallest change\n– the rule is spread over every route; a route\n  without a check is open and nothing notices\n– a new role means editing every route\n– nobody can see who may do what",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-optA",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optB",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 550,
   "y": 485.0,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 288.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 1435496104,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1977579323,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "adr-optB-text"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optB-text",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 556,
   "y": 491.0,
   "width": 468,
   "height": 260.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 333424232,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1648022005,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "B. One action → role chart in code\n\nHow it works: auth/actions.py lists every action and\nthe roles allowed it. Each route that changes\nsomething names its action (Depends(Requires(...)));\na test fails if one names none. /admin/roles draws\nthe chart. Users, argon2id password hashes and\nsessions are a new auth schema; each user is a\ncore.actor, so writes are audited as them.\n\n+ one file to read and change; default deny\n+ the chart's history is git's\n– changing the chart is a code change and a deploy",
   "originalText": "B. One action → role chart in code\n\nHow it works: auth/actions.py lists every action and\nthe roles allowed it. Each route that changes\nsomething names its action (Depends(Requires(...)));\na test fails if one names none. /admin/roles draws\nthe chart. Users, argon2id password hashes and\nsessions are a new auth schema; each user is a\ncore.actor, so writes are audited as them.\n\n+ one file to read and change; default deny\n+ the chart's history is git's\n– changing the chart is a code change and a deploy",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-optB",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
