   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Harder: serving it on a network needs HTTPS in front (the cookie is Secure off\nthis machine) and TRIALWATCH_HOSTS; a forgotten password needs an admin.",
   "originalText": "Harder: serving it on a network needs HTTPS in front (the cookie is Secure off\nthis machine) and TRIALWATCH_HOSTS; a forgotten password needs an admin.",
